# {{ .prefix }}-exploring

<!-- awf:section when-to-invoke -->
## When to invoke

Invoke this skill only when both the repository location is unknown and inline search would pollute the parent context. Keep an exact-known-file read or genuinely trivial lookup inline. Send one information need per call.
